*> Поиск в глубину рекурсией: программа VISIT объявлена RECURSIVE. Граф и отметки
*> посещения лежат в EXTERNAL-данных — они общие для всех программ в исполняемом файле.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MAIN.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-GRAPH EXTERNAL.
   05 WS-VERTEX OCCURS 6 TIMES.
      10 WS-ADJ PIC 9 OCCURS 2 TIMES.
01 WS-SEEN EXTERNAL.
   05 WS-VISITED PIC 9 OCCURS 6 TIMES.
01 WS-START PIC 9 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE "120304152534" TO WS-GRAPH
    MOVE ALL "0" TO WS-SEEN
    DISPLAY "DFS order:" WITH NO ADVANCING
    CALL "VISIT" USING WS-START
    DISPLAY SPACE
    STOP RUN.
END PROGRAM MAIN.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. VISIT RECURSIVE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-GRAPH EXTERNAL.
   05 WS-VERTEX OCCURS 6 TIMES.
      10 WS-ADJ PIC 9 OCCURS 2 TIMES.
01 WS-SEEN EXTERNAL.
   05 WS-VISITED PIC 9 OCCURS 6 TIMES.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 LS-K PIC 9.
01 LS-U PIC 9.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 L-V  PIC 9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-V.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-VISITED(L-V + 1)
    DISPLAY " " L-V WITH NO ADVANCING
    PERFORM VARYING LS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL LS-K > 2
        MOVE WS-ADJ(L-V + 1, LS-K) TO LS-U
        IF WS-VISITED(LS-U + 1) = 0
            CALL "VISIT" USING LS-U
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM VISIT.
